values ('c3d4e5f6-7a8b-4c55-8f45-5a6b7c8d9e15', 'digital-art-new-media', 'Digital Art / New Media', 'Digital Art / New Media is an advanced studio course in contemporary art practices that use digital tools, code, networks, time-based media, sensors, real-time systems, data, AI, and installation technologies. Students learn to make images, moving works, sound pieces, web-based artworks, generative sketches, interactive prototypes, 3D environments, and exhibition-ready projects while developing historical awareness, critique fluency, ethical judgment, technical resilience, and documentation practices.');

